==Strategy==
This level is filled with [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]], which have been heavily powercrept. Once you kill the Pengs that appear at the start, this level just becomes your basic Relic Bun-Bun killing simulator. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] is heavily recommended for his impressive stats and amazing Slow with almost 100% uptime, while [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] can stall everybody here excellently.

If you don't have the [[Heavenly Tower|Tow]][[Infernal Tower|ers]]' [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] yet, [[Uncanny Legends]] Mythics work wonders here, especially in their [[True Form]]. [[Luza]], [[Naala]] and [[Doron]] are prime examples.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|Anti-Relic]] crowd-controllers such as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Trickster Himeyuri (Uber Rare Cat)|Fox Queen Himeyuri]], [[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Section Chief Gravicci]] or [[Michelia (Uber Rare Cat)|Naptime Michelia CC]]. Though these options may be vulnerable to the [[Death Surge]]s from the Aku, they are still invaluable options.
*[[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|CAT-10 Gigapult]]: Its job here is to control and DPS the Relic enemies. It has Resistant + Weaken with 99% uptime. This Weaken drastically reduces the pushing power of the Relic Bun-Buns with proper meatshielding using [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]].

